// Brand packs: everything one brand's demo needs (seed, facts, brief, moves, card pages, pools, config).
// The default brand context is Brew itself (public/data/brew.js, the landing's seed): no brand data, never listed, routed or
// watched. Every brand is generated by the build
// (build.js) into .brands/<slug>/ and mirrored to gs://<bucket>/brands/<slug>/.
